          "type": "text",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>Our artists paint every dungeon stone in flat 16-color indexed palettes. By pairing each sprite sheet with a hand-painted surface normal map, a single pixel shader casts crisp flickering shadows at a locked 120 frames per second.</p>",
